  </p>

  <h2>QC checklist for coat rows</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Length &amp; fit:</strong> flat lay shoulder-to-hem vs your size reference.</li>
    <li><strong>Lining &amp; plaid:</strong> pattern continuity at seams and vents.</li>
    <li><strong>Hardware:</strong> zipper stacks, branded pulls, button engravings.</li>
    <li><strong>Badge / patch (if applicable):</strong> embroidery density, attachment angle.</li>
    <li><strong>Fur trim:</strong> verify colour and attachment—common bait-and-switch vector.</li>
  </ol>

